{123}{Well, you see, there's this story from way back when about how this human woman who wanted to live forever made a deal with a demon. She got her wish but she became a demon herself. He turned her into a spider - because she was a weaver-woman, you see - but she has the power to make people see her as a beautiful woman.}{Well, you see, there's this story from way back when about how this human woman who wanted to live forever made a deal with a demon. She got her wish but she became a demon herself. He turned her into a spider - because she was a weaver-woman, you see - but she has the power to make people see her as a beautiful woman.}{}{}{}{ru 2229}
{124}{Ahh, yes. I've heard a variation of this when I was a child. Please, continue.}{}{5}{}{128}{}
