{132}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{133}{After she leaves, she finds a quiet, dark place close by and lays her eggs. A few days later, the eggs hatch, and the village is quickly over-run by the baby spiders. You see, they too have their momma's power to cloud your mind, and make you think you like them. Like I said, it's just an old wives' tale. A story about why you should be careful who you open your door to.}{After she leaves, she finds a quiet, dark place close by and lays her eggs. A few days later, the eggs hatch, and the village is quickly over-run by the baby spiders. You see, they too have their momma's power to cloud your mind, and make you think you like them. Like I said, it's just an old wives' tale. A story about why you should be careful who you open your door to.}{}{}{}{gf 2812 1}
